        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Strike</p><hr /><p><em>A corked flask holding a chaotic mixture of four thin liquids that never quite blend: corrosive green, icy blue, pale crackling gold, and glowing orange.</em></p><p>When you Strike with this vial, you choose its damage type: acid, cold, electricity, or fire. The vial's initial and splash damage both use the chosen type.</p><p>The bomb deals 2d6 damage of the chosen type and 2 splash damage of that type.</p><p><strong>Advanced Vial (11th level)</strong> When you create the vial, you can treat it as made of one special material of your choice: adamantine, cold iron, or dawnsilver.</p>"
